From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:02:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/47] Add ImageFormat

Names and values come from the ImageFormat name table of CS2 2000930 (linux),
checked against the win64 ImageFormat to VkFormat table. The header path
follows the Source SDK 2013 precedent (public/bitmap/imageformat.h).
---
 public/bitmap/imageformat_declarations.h | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 86 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 public/bitmap/imageformat_declarations.h

diff --git a/public/bitmap/imageformat_declarations.h b/public/bitmap/imageformat_declarations.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..523f5f7e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/public/bitmap/imageformat_declarations.h
@@ -0,0 +1,86 @@
